        {
            "title": "拓璞數控基石投資者禁售期滿   涉近8%股份",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">拓璞數控(07688)公布，基石投資者獲分配3266.5萬股H股，佔已發行股本約7.79%。有關H股須遵守上市起計為期6個月的禁售期，禁售期最後一日為昨日。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：拓璞數控官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20260512_FI_source-web_07688-2.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：拓璞數控官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20260512_FI_source-web_07688-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：拓璞數控官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">該集團指，據董事經查詢後所知，大部分基石投資者已表示認可該集團的長期價值及發展前景，並對集團在航空、航天、人形機器人等領域的五軸數控機床及智能製造裝備的增長潛力充滿信心。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17221867-%e6%8b%93%e7%92%9e%e6%95%b8%e6%8e%a7%e5%9f%ba%e7%9f%b3%e6%8a%95%e8%b3%87%e8%80%85%e7%a6%81%e5%94%ae%e6%9c%9f%e6%bb%bf-%e6%b6%89%e8%bf%918%e8%82%a1%e4%bb%bd",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/07688-Web.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-20 09:23:41",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
