            "title": "即月期指開跌195點   低水229點",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">即月期指開報22,613，跌195點或0.86%，低水229點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">科指期貨開報3,578，跌67點或1.84%，低水71點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國指期貨開報7,629，跌57點或0.74%，低水61點。</p>\n</div>",
